return ['domain'=>'zinn-reseller','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'ha','project-id-version'=>'zinn-reseller','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:38:01+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T20:38:01+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Reseller Toolkit'=>'Zinn® Reseller Toolkit','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-reseller','Sell Zinn Digital® hosting from your own WordPress site — footprint-free PBN, WordPress, WooCommerce, agency, reseller, cloud and VPS hosting. Search and offer domains from your reseller account, sign your clients straight into their hosting panel, and provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order is paid.'=>'Sayar da Zinn Digital® hosting daga shafin ku na WordPress — footprint-free PBN, WordPress, WooCommerce, agency, reseller, cloud da VPS hosting. Nemi kuma ku ba da yankuna daga asusun ku na reseller, sanya abokan cinikin ku kai tsaye cikin rukunin hosting dinsu, kuma ku samar da hosting ta atomatik lokacin da aka biya oda ta WooCommerce.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','The hosting platform answered with status %d.'=>'Dandalin karbar bakuncin yanar gizo ya amsa da matsayi %d.','Find your domain name'=>'Nemo sunan domain ɗinka','Search'=>'Nemoƙa','No extensions were checked for that name.'=>'Ba a duba wata ƙari ba don wannan suna.','Domain search is unavailable on this site at the moment.'=>'Binciken yanki ba ya samuwa a wannan rukunin yanar gizon a halin yanzu.','We could not reach the domain registry just now. Please try again in a moment.'=>'Ba mu iya isa ga rajistar yankin a yanzu ba. Don Allah a sake gwadawa nan da dan lokaci.','The API key is missing or no longer valid. Check it under Settings → Zinn® Reseller.'=>'An bace maɓallin API ko kuma ba ya aiki. Duba shi a ƙarƙashin Saituna → Zinn® Reseller.','This API key does not carry the sites.view permission, which the domain search needs. Add it to the key in your reseller panel, or clear the key here to fall back to the public search.'=>'Wannan maɓallin API ɗin ba shi da izinin sites.view, wanda binciken yanki ke buƙata. Ƙara shi zuwa ga maɓallin a cikin rukunin dillalin ku, ko share maɓallin a nan don komawa zuwa binciken jama\'a.','Only administrators see this:'=>'Masu gudanarwa kawai ke ganin wannan:','We could not check this one — try again'=>'Ba mu iya bincika wannan ba — sake gwadawa','Already registered'=>'An riga an yi rajista','Available — ask us for a price'=>'Akwai — tambaye mu farashi','Available — %1$s %2$s for the first year'=>'Akwai — %1$s %2$s na shekara ta farko','Register it'=>'Yi rijistar sa','Manage my hosting'=>'Gudanar da abubuwan daukar shafina na yanar gizo','Please sign in first.'=>'Da fatan za a fara shiga ciki.','This account is not linked to a hosting service yet.'=>'Ba a haɗa wannan asusun da sabis na ɗaukar shafuka ba tukuna.','The hosting platform did not return a sign-in link.'=>'Dandaminin ajiyar shafin bai dawo da hanyar shiga ba.','Reseller Toolkit'=>'Kayan Aiki na Mai Sayarwa','Account'=>'Asusunka','Features'=>'Abubuwan da ke ciki','Styling'=>'Salon Kayan Aiki','Your Zinn Digital® reseller account'=>'Asusun dillalin ku na Zinn Digital®','Create a reseller API key in your Zinn® dashboard under Settings → API keys, and paste it here.'=>'Ka ƙirƙiri maɓallin API na mai siyarwa a cikin allon sarrafa Zinn® ɗinka a ƙarƙashin Saituna → Maɓallan API, sannan ka manna shi a nan.','Reseller API key'=>'Maɓallin API na mai siyarwa','Held on this site only, and never included in an export or a diagnostics report.'=>'An adana su a wannan rukunin yanar gizon kawai, kuma ba a haɗa su da wani fitarwa ko rahoton bincike ba.','Plan to provision'=>'Shirin samarwa','The plan code new customers are put on. Leave blank to be asked each time.'=>'Lambar shirin da za a sanya sababbin abokan ciniki a kai. Bar shi a bude domin a tambaye shi a duk lokacin da ake bukata.','API address'=>'Adreshin API','Leave this alone unless Zinn® support has asked you to change it.'=>'Bar wannan shi kadai idan har goyon bayan Zinn® bai nemi ka canza shi ba.','Control-panel address'=>'Adireshin sashin kula da abubuwa','Where the “My hosting” link sends your customers.'=>'Inda mahaɗin “My hosting” ke tura abokan cinikinka.','Domain search'=>'Binciken domain','Provide the [zinn_domain_search] shortcode'=>'Bayar da gajeren lambar [zinn_domain_search]','Put the shortcode on any page to let visitors check a domain and buy it through you.'=>'Sanya ɗan gajeren lambar akan kowane shafi domin barin baƙi su bincika yanki kuma su saya ta wurinku.','Panel link'=>'Hadin shafi','Show a “My hosting” link to signed-in customers'=>'Nuna hanyar haɗi ta “Hosting ɗina” ga abokan ciniki da suka shiga shafin','WooCommerce provisioning'=>'Shirye-shiryen WooCommerce','Provision hosting automatically when a WooCommerce order completes'=>'Sanya masauki ta atomatik lokacin da oda ta WooCommerce ta kammala','Only takes effect on orders containing a product you have mapped to a Zinn® plan.'=>'Yana aiki ne kawai a kan oda da ta ƙunshi wani samfur da ka tsara zuwa wani tsari na Zinn®.','Domain search appearance'=>'Bayyanar binciken yanki','This widget renders inside your own theme. Pick a preset, or set your own colours — either way nothing is added to your pages that a visitor can see as ours.'=>'Wannan widget ɗin yana aiki ne a cikin jigarka. Zaɓi wani tsari, ko ka saita launukanka — ta kowace hanya babu abin da ake ƙarawa a shafukanka wanda baƙo zai iya gani a matsayin namu.','Every class the widget uses is listed in the plugin’s readme, so a developer can override anything a preset does not cover.'=>'An all class da widget ke amfani da su an jera su a cikin readme na plugin ɗin, ta yadda mai haɓakawa zai iya ɓata duk abin da ƙa\'idar da aka riga aka saita ba ta rufe ba.','Follow my theme'=>'Bitaken jigo na','Soft'=>'Mai laushi','High contrast'=>'Babban bambanci','Compact'=>'Matsakaici','Buy-link colour'=>'Launin hanyar siya','“Available” colour'=>'Launin “Available”','“Could not check” colour'=>'Launi mai "Ba a iya bincika ba"','Error colour'=>'Launi na kuskure','Corner rounding'=>'Zagewar kusurwa','Space inside each row'=>'Sarari a cikin kowane jeri','Text size'=>'Girman rubutu','Domain-name weight'=>'Nauyin sunan yanki','No reseller API key yet.'=>'Baabu maɓallin API na mai sayarwa tukunja.','Nothing here works until a key is set. Create one in your Zinn® dashboard under Settings → API keys.'=>'Babu abin da yake aiki anan har sai an saita key. Ƙirƙiri ɗaya a cikin dashboard ɗinka na Zinn® a ƙarƙashin Settings → API keys.','Open my Zinn® dashboard'=>'Buɗe dashboard ɗina na Zinn®','A key is set, but nothing is switched on.'=>'An saita maɓalli, amma babu abin da aka kunna.','None of the three features is enabled, so this plugin is doing nothing on your site. Turn on what you need under Features.'=>'Babu wani abu daga cikin abubuwa uku da aka kunna, saboda haka wannan plugin ɗin ba ya komai a kan shafin ku. Kunna abin da kuke buƙata a ƙarƙashin Features.','Open Features'=>'Bude Fasaloli','Ready — %d feature switched on.'=>'Shirye — an kunna fasali %d.' . "\0" . 'Shirye — an kunna fasali %d.','Selling from'=>'Sayarwa daga','Settings'=>'Saituna','No API key yet, so nothing is connected.'=>'Babu maɓallin API tukuna, don haka babu abin da aka haɗa.','Not connected: %s'=>'Ba a haɗa ba: %s','Connected. Your reseller programme is %s.'=>'An haɗa. Shirin dillalin ku shine %s.','No Zinn® API key is configured, so nothing was provisioned.'=>'Ba a saita maɓallin API na Zinn® ba, don haka ba a tanadi komai ba.','This order did not include a domain name, so there was nothing to provision.'=>'Wannan odar ba ta haɗa da suna ba, don haka babu abin da za a saita.','The hosting platform did not return a site.'=>'Dandalin daukar nauyi bai dawo da shafin ba.','Zinn® hosting provisioned for %1$s (service %2$s).'=>'An samar da Zinn® hosting don %1$s (sabis %2$s).','The hosting platform did not return a client account.'=>'Dandalin karbar bakuncin yanar gizo bai dawo da asusun abokin ciniki ba.','Zinn® hosting was NOT provisioned: %s'=>'Ba a ba da damar Zinn® hosting ba: %s','Zinn® product line'=>'Layin samfuran Zinn®','The Zinn® product line to provision when this product is bought. Leave blank to use the default from the plugin settings.'=>'Layin samfurin Zinn® wanda za a samar lokacin da aka sayi wannan samfurin. Bar shi a fanko don amfani da tsohuwa daga saitunan plugin din.','Zinn® hosting'=>'Zinn® hosting','Service id'=>'Lambar hidima','Nothing provisioned for this order.'=>'Ba abin da aka tsara don wannan oda.','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'An adana shi. Rubuta sabon ƙima don maye gurbin sa.','Filter this list…'=>'Tace wannan jerin...','Filter this list'=>'Tace wannan lissafin','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Babu abin da ya dace da wannan matatar.','Add a row'=>'Ƙara jerin shafi','Remove this row'=>'Cire wannan sahu','Remove'=>'Cire','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — bayyani','Overview'=>'Bayani Na Gaba ɗaya','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kowane plugin na Zinn® a wannan shafin, da kuma ko yana aiki.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Ba a buƙatar haɗin intanit don wannan plugin ɗin.','Open settings'=>'Buɗe saituna','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Ba ka da izinin canza waɗannan saitunan.','Settings sections'=>'Sashen saituna','Support'=>'Tallafi','Save changes'=>'Ajiye canje-canje','Tools'=>'Kayan aiki','Export settings'=>'Saitunan fitarwa','Reset to defaults'=>'Sake wa ga-tsohuwar sifa','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Wannan zai dawo da duk wani tsari a kan wannan plugin zuwa ga asalin saitinsa na farko. A ci gaba?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Binciken don goyon baya','Import a settings file'=>'Shigo da fayil ɗin saiti','Import'=>'Shigo da kaya','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Fayilolin da aka fitar ba sa ƙunshe da kalmomin sirri, alamomi (tokens), ko maɓallan API — za buƙaci ka sake shigar da su a sabon rukunin yanar gizon.','Settings saved.'=>'An adana saitunan.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Kowane saiti a kan wannan plugin ya koma tsohon matsayinsa.','Done.'=>'An gama.','That action is not available.'=>'Ba a samun damar yin wannan aikin.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Ba a iya karanta wannan fayil ɗin ba. Zaɓi fayil ɗin saitunan da aka fitar daga wani matosai na Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Waccan fayil din ya yi yawa da zai zama fitar da saituna.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Wannan fayil ɗin ba fitarwa ba ce ta saitunan Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'An fitar da wannan fayil ɗin ne daga wani plugin daban (%s), don haka shigo da shi anan zai adana saitunan da wannan plugin ɗin bai fahimta ba.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'An shigo da saitin %d. Kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API ba sa cikin fitarwa, don haka a sake shigar da su.' . "\0" . 'An shigo da saituna %d. Kalmomin sirri da maɓallan API ba sa cikin fitarwa, don haka a sake shigar da su.','Connected'=>'An Haɗa','Connecting…'=>'Ana haɗawa...','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'An haɗa, amma wani abu na buƙatar kulawa','Not connected'=>'Ba a haɗa ba','Running on your own account'=>'Ana gudu a kan asusunka naka','We could not check this'=>'Ba mu iya bincika wannan ba','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Wannan ffulgin ɗin bai ba da dalili ba. A aika da rahoton bincike kuma za mu duba.','Connection status'=>'Matsayin haɗi','Last checked %s ago.'=>'An bincika karshe tun %s.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(yana buɗe a sabon shafin)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Aiko wa zuwa ga goyon bayan Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Wannan shineini abin da za a aika - babu wani abu kuma, kuma babu wani abin da aka ɓoye. Kalmomin sirrinka, alamomi da maɓallan API ba su ciki.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Rahoton binciken da za a aika','Copy to clipboard'=>'Kwafi zuwa allo','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Aika da wannan rahoton ga tallafin Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Muna bude maka tikitin goyon baya kuma mu ba da amsa ta imel. Idan ka fi son kada ka aiko da shi, ka kwafe shi a sama ka manna shi a cikin tikiti da kanka.','Copied'=>'An kwafi','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Ba mu iya isa ga Zinn Digital® ba daga wannan uwar garken (%s). Kwafi rahoton da ke sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti maimakon haka — babu abin da ya yi kuskure game da saitunanka.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'An tura. Taimakon Zinn® yana da rahotonku kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Taimakon Zinn® ya karɓi rahotonku — lamba %s — kuma zai ba da amsa ta imel.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Ka aika da rahotanni da yawa a cikin dan kankanin lokaci. Jira \'yan mintoci kaɗan sannan ka sake gwadawa — waɗanda suka gabata sun isa.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ta kasa karɓar rahoton a yanzu — matsalar daga ɓangarenmu ce, ba daga gare ku ba. Gwada sake yi nan ba da jimawa ba, ko kuma ku kwafe rahoton da ke sama zuwa cikin tikiti.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'An ƙi amincewa da rahoton (HTTP %d). Kwafi shi a sama sannan ka buɗe tikiti, tare da ambaton wannan lamba.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — jagorori da ayyuka','User guides'=>'Jagororin mai amfani','Read the %s user guide'=>'Karanta jagorar mai amfani ta %s','Hide this'=>'Boye da wannan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Zinn® hosting don WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, ajiyar bayanai ta yau da kullum, ƙaura kyauta da kuma wani kwamitin sarrafawa da aka gina domin mutanen da ke gudanar da fiye da shafi ɗaya.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Kasuwancin Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Sayen da sayar da shafuka da aka kafa, yankuna, da wuraren sanya hanyoyin sadarwa, tare da riƙe kuɗin lafiya har sai bangarorin biyu sun gamsu.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — dauki ma\'aikatan da suke yin wannan a matsayin sana\'a','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Kasuwancinmu na masu zaman kansu na duniya: bincika ayyuka sama da 10,000 da aka riga aka shirya daga marubuta, masu zanen kaya, masu haɓakawa da ƙwararrun SEO, ko sanya wani aikin kuma bari su yi ciniki.','Style preset'=>'Tsarin salo','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Wani wurin farawa. Duk wani abu da ke ƙasa yana shafe shi.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Yi amfani da launuka da girmofi na kaina','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Bar wannan a kashe kuma ana amfani da saitaccen tsari yadda yake.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Duba bayanan fitowar Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sabuntawar da aka sauke ta gaza gwajin inganci kuma ba a sanya ta ba.']];